{"unit_id":"grloper__dsh-deep-research#feature-verify","repo":"grloper/dsh-deep-research","commit":"ab404d847f8cd5a2521f91ecb79cfc95c67734dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Kestrel 的功能「文本事实核查」：把输入文本拆成可检查的事实主张，搜集支持和反驳证据，并在原文中机械定位引文后返回逐条报告。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:932-967"]}
{"unit_id":"grloper__dsh-deep-research#feature-research","repo":"grloper/dsh-deep-research","commit":"ab404d847f8cd5a2521f91ecb79cfc95c67734dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Kestrel 的功能「对抗式深度研究」：输入研究问题并选择深度模式，系统拆分问题、并行搜集支持与反驳材料，再按证据缺口迭代并报告未解决之处。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1098-1138"]}
{"unit_id":"grloper__dsh-deep-research#feature-compare","repo":"grloper/dsh-deep-research","commit":"ab404d847f8cd5a2521f91ecb79cfc95c67734dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Kestrel 的功能「来源独立性比较」：提交报道同一事件的多个 URL，系统抓取内容并分析转载、改写和引用关系，返回独立来源及其衍生关系。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1016-1065"]}
{"unit_id":"grloper__dsh-deep-research#feature-source","repo":"grloper/dsh-deep-research","commit":"ab404d847f8cd5a2521f91ecb79cfc95c67734dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Kestrel 的功能「单页来源评估」：输入一个 URL 后获取页面，输出来源类型、可信度信号、内容质量线索以及发布日期置信度和警告。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:971-1012"]}
{"unit_id":"grloper__dsh-deep-research#feature-recall","repo":"grloper/dsh-deep-research","commit":"ab404d847f8cd5a2521f91ecb79cfc95c67734dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Kestrel 的功能「历史发现召回」：输入查询词，从证据图谱检索过往核查结论，并显示判定、置信度及新鲜度状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1142-1184"]}
